### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Create a router
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Core Router",
  "deviceType": "ROUTER",
  "manufacturer": "Cisco",
  "model": "ISR 1000",
  "ipAddress": "192.168.10.1",
  "location": "Networking Lab",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "notes": "Sample data for API testing"
}

### List all devices
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices

### Search devices
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices?q=core

### Filter by type and status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices?type=ROUTER&status=ACTIVE

### Get one device (replace 1 with the ID returned by POST)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/1

### Update a device
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Core Router - Updated",
  "deviceType": "ROUTER",
  "manufacturer": "Cisco",
  "model": "ISR 1000",
  "ipAddress": "192.168.10.1",
  "location": "CPUT Bellville Lab",
  "status": "MAINTENANCE",
  "notes": "Updated sample record"
}

### Delete a device
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/1
